INSERT INTO "blog_posts" ("slug", "title", "excerpt", "content", "seo_description", "is_published", "published_at")
VALUES (
  'what-vibhavgpt-offers-and-how-pricing-works',
  'What VibhavGPT offers — and how pricing works',
  'A clear guide to VibhavGPT''s chat workspace, model tiers, generation tools, thinking effort, and Flex Credits.',
  '# What VibhavGPT offers — and how pricing works\n\nVibhavGPT is a calm workspace for thinking, creating, and keeping useful context close at hand. Ask questions, work through ideas, and return to conversations without starting from scratch.\n\n## One workspace for everyday work\n\nVibhavGPT combines a few practical tools in one place:\n\n- **Chat:** move from quick questions to complex planning and writing in the same conversation.\n- **Web search:** get current information with source links when a question needs the latest facts.\n- **Memory:** save durable preferences, profile details, interests, tools, and ongoing project context so future conversations can be more useful.\n- **Image generation:** turn a description into an image when your plan includes image generation.\n- **Document generation:** create downloadable Word documents, PowerPoint presentations, PDFs, Markdown, and other useful file formats.\n- **News:** request a concise current briefing with original summaries and links back to the sources.\n- **Voice input and file reading:** speak into the composer or attach documents and images when that is the fastest way to explain what you need.\n\n## The four VibhavGPT tiers\n\nEvery tier uses the same VibhavGPT workspace. The difference is how much access and included usage each plan provides.\n\n### Free — $0\n\nFree includes VibhavGPT Spark and Nova. You get 5 Spark messages and 5 Nova messages per rolling week, for up to 10 messages when both allowances are used. Free also includes 5 MB file and image uploads and 2 voice exchanges per week. Image and document generation are not included.\n\n### Plus — $4.99/month or $53.99/year\n\nPlus adds unlimited Spark and Nova, plus 30 Prime usage units and 5 Ultra usage units per billing month. It also includes 20 combined image and document generations per billing month, 25 MB document uploads, 10 MB image uploads, and 10 voice exchanges per week.\n\n### Pro — $12.99/month or $140.99/year\n\nPro unlocks unlimited Spark, Nova, Prime, Ultra, image generation, and document generation. It includes 80 MB document uploads, 20 MB image uploads, and unlimited voice, subject to fair-use protections for unusually heavy activity.\n\n## Thinking effort\n\nPrime and Ultra offer selectable thinking effort levels. Normal effort uses the standard allowance. On Plus, higher effort consumes more message units because it uses more work for the response: Prime High uses 1.5 units, while Prime Extra High or maximum effort uses 2 units. Ultra Extra High or maximum effort uses 1.5 units; Ultra Normal, Low, and High use 1 unit. Pro includes all effort levels without a monthly cap, with fair-use protection for the most expensive requests. Spark and Nova do not use the thinking-effort selector.\n\n## Flex Credits\n\nFlex Credits supplement included plan allowances. They are useful for Prime and Ultra usage after a Plus allowance is used, and for image or document generation after Plus''s 20 included generations. Credits never expire.\n\nYou receive 10 credits per dollar through $5, $10, $20, and $50 purchase buttons, or a custom amount. That means $5 gives 50 credits, $10 gives 100, $20 gives 200, and $50 gives 500. A normal Prime message uses 1 credit and a normal Ultra message uses 3 credits when credits are needed. Each image or document generation beyond an included quota uses 1 credit. If a generation fails, its reserved credit is returned.\n\n## Billing and refunds\n\nAll sales are final. VibhavGPT does not issue refunds under any circumstances. You can cancel a paid plan at any time and keep access through the end of the current paid period, but no money is returned. For help, contact [support@pansophy.com](mailto:support@pansophy.com).\n\nYour plan, payment method, invoices, and cancellation controls are available from the profile menu under **Plan and billing**. Usage details and reset dates are available under **Usage & limits**.\n',
  'A friendly, accurate guide to VibhavGPT features, Free, Plus, and Pro pricing, thinking effort, Flex Credits, and the no-refunds policy.',
  true,
  now()
)
ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;
